{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 63, :comments ["And the reason for <b>\"These are the accountings of Moses and Eleazar\"</b> — regarding the accountings of the children of Israel: the accountings of the Levites are not included, for concerning them it is not said, \"But among these there was not a man,\" because that decree was not decreed upon the tribe of Levi, according to the words of our Sages (Bava Batra 121a). And the proof is Eleazar, and also Phinehas."], :book :numbers, :voice :ramban, :lang :en, :chapter 26, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T04:09:06.488874126Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}